Author: Jiada Zhan [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jiada (James) Zhan <jzha832@emory.edu>
Date: 2026-05-28
Description: MSMICA uses mass spectrometry evidence, chromatography evidence, and biological evidence for metabolite identification. This publication version uses the optimized empirical RT/correlation calibration, soft rank prior, and 80% empirical adduct/isotope clustering thresholds. The output is a list of identified metabolites with one assigned adduct form, m/z, and retention time.
